== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Fallen Valkyries|Aggressive creature strategies#Fallen Valkyrie}}

=== Spit ===
Fallen Valkyries will fly back slightly before thrusting forward to launch three projectiles that explode on impact and create circular fields of fire 2 meters in radius, which inflict the [[Burning]] and [[Poison]] statuses (80 [[Damage types#Fire|Fire]] and 18 [[Damage types#Poison|Poison]] damage). Each projectile travels at 14 meters per second for up to 10 second before despawning and has a spread of 10–20 degrees. This attack can be used every 10 seconds when within 7–15 meters of a player.

=== Claws ===
Brings both talons up before swinging down to scratch the player (105 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] and 55 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]] damage). This creates a vertical hitbox that extends outward 6.04 meters and arcs 60.2 degrees. They can use this attack every 3 seconds when within 3–5 meters of a player.

=== Spin ===
Folds both wings inward before extending them fully and spinning (80 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 140 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]], 100 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 100 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). This hits in a circular area 5.67 meters in radius. It can be used every 10 seconds when within 6 meters of a player.

